-- src:1168 | hiểm cùng Hợp đồng bảo hiểm với bố/mẹ ruột, bố/mẹ nuôi hoặc người giám hộ hợp pháp của Trẻ
-- src:1169 | em vị thành niên.
-- src:1181 | d. Công dân các nước bị cấm vận theo nghị quyết của Liên Hiệp Quốc, Hợp Chủng Quốc Hoa Kỳ,
-- src:1182 | Liên Hiệp Châu Âu và Vương Quốc Anh không phải là Bên mua bảo hiểm/ Người được bảo hiểm
-- src:1183 | theo Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 3(c): the oldest age insured` MEANS 65

GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 3(c): the oldest age insured on a renewal` MEANS 80

GIVEN s IS A `The policy schedule`
      d IS A DATE
      p IS AN `An insured person`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`general provision 3(c)-(d): the insured is eligible, under` s `, on` d `:` p MEANS
        "(c) a citizen, or resident"     ... (p's `a Vietnamese citizen` OR `resident in Vietnam:` p)
    AND "(c) from six months"            ... `six months old or more:` p `on` d
    AND "(c) to 65, or 80 on renewal"    ... `the age of` p `on` d AT MOST `the oldest age`
    AND "(c) a minor with a parent"      ... ((NOT (`a minor:` p `on` d)) OR p's `insured under the same contract as a parent, adoptive parent or legal guardian`)
    AND "(d) not under sanctions"        ... NOT p's `a citizen of a country under United Nations, United States, European Union or United Kingdom sanctions`
    AND "the place in the group"         ... `the place in the group is one the definitions allow`
    WHERE
        `the oldest age` MEANS
            IF s's `a renewal`
            THEN `general provision 3(c): the oldest age insured on a renewal`
            ELSE `general provision 3(c): the oldest age insured`
        `the place in the group is one the definitions allow` MEANS
            CONSIDER p's `place in the group`
            WHEN `an employee of the employer` THEN `old enough to be an employee:` p `on` d
            WHEN `a dependant` r               THEN `within the definition of a dependant:` p `on` d
            OTHERWISE TRUE

-- (c), second paragraph: a foreign insured resident in Vietnam must keep a valid visa or
-- temporary residence card. Otherwise the Company may hold or refuse the claim, and/or the
-- contract ends for that insured from the expiry of the latest visa or card; no premium is
-- refunded if the Company has paid any claim for that insured.
