GIVEN p IS AN `An insured person`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`general provision 3(c): the Company may hold or refuse the claim of` p MEANS
        NOT p's `a Vietnamese citizen`
    AND NOT p's `keeps a valid visa or temporary residence card`

