§§ `4. Conditions precedent to liability`

-- (a) The Company is liable only if (i) every statement and declaration needed was given in
-- the application and was complete, true and accurate, including those about dependants, and
-- (ii) the premium condition of general provision 16 is met. (b) If any is not, no liability
-- arises, and the Company may refuse the claim and/or end the contract.
-- (i) is applied in lpa-claim.l4 from the claim facts; (ii) in lpa-termination.l4, with the
-- conflict between 4(b) and 16B(b) recorded as fork F31.
-- src:1199 | (a) Bất kỳ trách nhiệm nào của Công ty đối với Người được bảo hiểm sẽ chỉ phát sinh nếu các điều
