§§ `10. Refusal of claims`

-- The Company may refuse a claim outside the cover or within an exclusion (inert: it restates
-- Law 08/2022/QH15 art 20(1)(d), aid line 456-458; the cover decision is lpa-claim.l4).
-- src:1440 | Công ty có quyền từ chối bồi thường, trả tiền bảo hiểm trong trường hợp không thuộc phạm vi trách nhiệm
-- src:1441 | bảo hiểm hoặc trường hợp loại trừ trách nhiệm bảo hiểm theo thoả thuận trong Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.

§§ `11. Other insurance`

-- Anyone with other health or accident insurance must tell the Company and give it copies.
-- For medical expenses for the same Injury claimable under other insurance, the Company pays
-- only the excess over what the other insurance pays, or the share its limit bears to the
-- total limits of all contracts; an overpayment must be refunded.
-- Benefit C applies limitation 4's excess rule (fork F14); the rateable share is encoded so a
-- reader can compare the two (NOTES.md, Findings).
