§§ `12. Medical examination`

-- While a claim is pending, the Company may have any insured examined, as often as reasonably
-- required, and an autopsy where neither law nor religion forbids it. The Company pays, unless
-- the claim proves invalid, when it recovers the costs from the policyholder or insured.
