GIVEN `the claim proved invalid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A side to the contract`
`general provision 12: who bears the cost of the examination, the claim having proved invalid:` `the claim proved invalid` MEANS
    IF `the claim proved invalid`
    THEN `the policyholder or the insured`
    ELSE `the Company`

§§ `14. Governing law and disputes`

-- Vietnamese law governs. A dispute is first negotiated and conciliated; if not settled within
-- thirty days of one party notifying the other, the parties submit to the exclusive
-- jurisdiction of the competent Vietnamese court.
-- Fork F26: the thirty days run from the day after the notice, so the court is open from the
-- 31st day.
