GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 14: the days for amicable settlement` MEANS 30

GIVEN `the day the dispute was notified` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`general provision 14: the first day a party may go to court, the dispute notified on` `the day the dispute was notified` MEANS
    `the day the dispute was notified` PLUS `general provision 14: the days for amicable settlement` PLUS 1

-- The same as a permission, on a clock of days from the notice: a court filing before day 31
-- is a nullity, not a performance.
GIVETH A DEONTIC `An actor` `An act`
`general provision 14: a party may go to court` MEANS
    PARTY `a party to the dispute`
    MAY   `bring the dispute before a Vietnamese court`
    AFTER 31

§§ `15. Language`

-- The contract is made in Vietnamese and may be translated; the Vietnamese prevails. Inert:
-- this encoding reads the Vietnamese (src 1530-1533).

§§ `17. Currency`

-- Benefits are paid in Vietnamese đồng. Where conversion is needed, the rate is the transfer
-- selling rate of Vietcombank (or of Citibank) at the time of the decision or of payment. The
-- wording does not say which bank or which moment is chosen, nor who chooses (NOTES.md,
-- Findings). The rate is an input.
