GIVEN `the amount in the other currency` IS A NUMBER
      `the transfer selling rate`        IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`general provision 17: the amount in VND of` `the amount in the other currency` `at` `the transfer selling rate` MEANS
    `the amount in the other currency` TIMES `the transfer selling rate`

§ `Conversion to an individual contract`

-- After at least one year insured under the group contract, the policyholder or insured may
-- ask to convert to an individual contract; the Company may ask for more information, decides
-- the terms, and may refuse "theo quyết định đơn phương của Công ty". The request is a right;
-- the outcome is the Company's unilateral discretion (NOTES.md, Findings).
-- LAW: Law 08/2022/QH15 art 42(6)(b) (aid line 884-887) requires a group contract to state the
-- conditions and procedure for conversion.
